    "aboutLead": "Every journey starts with a single step they say, and so did ours. In a small 20-bed hospital in the year 1992, an establishment that would grow into one of Central India's biggest healthcare group was born.",
    "aboutP1": "After 5 years of incredible hard work and a distant vision and efforts of our founder Dr. Ajay Goenka, we managed to upgrade into a premier super specialty hospital with 100 beds. Our mission of providing quality healthcare started showing promise.",
    "aboutP2": "In 2004, we started a Cardiac centre devoted to the treatment of those in need of critical cardiac care. From then on Chirayu just kept adding new feathers to its hat.........",
