    "chairmanQuote": "\"The man you know, the Journey you don't\"",
    "chairmanP1": "Here's the official documentary \"LOVE COVID\" which offers an insight into the vision of the man on a mission to fight COVID-19 with his \"Chirayu Corona Warriors\".",
